<view class="screen"><view class="eyebrow">WHALEU · 我的发布</view><view class="title">每一次发布都有回音</view><view class="subtitle">这里只展示发布状态。被隐藏或删除的内容不会通过此入口恢复展示。</view><navigator class="link" url="/pages/community-compose/community-compose">检查本账号待确认的帖子或评论 →</navigator><view class="status" aria-role="status">{{status}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" aria-role="alert">{{error}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="onReload" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">重新加载发布记录</button><button wx:if="{{busy}}" bindtap="onCancel">停止等待</button><navigator wx:if="{{!hasSession}}" class="link" url="/pages/login/login">登录后查看</navigator><view wx:for="{{publications}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="label">{{item.status === 'published' ? '已发布' : (item.status === 'hidden' ? '已隐藏' : '已删除')}}</view><view class="meta">{{item.publishedAt}}</view><navigator wx:if="{{item.status === 'published'}}" class="link" url="/pages/community-detail/community-detail?postId={{item.id}}">查看帖子 →</navigator><view wx:else class="notice">此记录不包含正文、图片或身份资料</view></view><view wx:if="{{loaded &amp;&amp; !publications.length}}" class="empty">暂无发布记录</view><button wx:if="{{canLoadMore}}" class="secondary" bindtap="onMore" disabled="{{busy}}">加载更多</button><navigator class="link" url="/pages/community-feed/community-feed">返回校园社区 →</navigator></view>
